    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "BARRY AUCTIONEERS & VALUERS are delighted to present to the market this uniqually designed detached two storey family home, situated in the very scenic Mardyke Walk - a residential and sportsground cul de sac fabled in Cork’s famous anthem “The Banks of My Own Lovely Lee”. \r\n\r\nThis property was newly built in 2023/24 and is in excellent condition throughout with gas heating and double glazing throughout. “Glandore” also boasts a B3 energy rating. \r\n\r\nPositioned adjacent to the scenic Fitzgerald’s Park and within a short stroll of University College Cork, Cork University Hospital, and the vibrant city centre, you can enjoy the best of city living while benefiting from the tranquillity of this mature and established residential area, with riverside walks, cafés, schools, sports clubs, and excellent transport links all close at hand. \r\n\r\nThis exceptional home presents a rare opportunity to acquire a turnkey property in a prime Cork City address."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "ACCOMMODATION: \r\nEntrance Hallway: 1.95m x 5.25m\t\r\n\r\nLiving / Dining / Kitchen: 6.9m x 4.91m \t\r\nLocated on the first floor with views over the park. Fitted kitchen with wall and floor units. \r\n\r\nDownstairs Bathroom: 3.95m x 2m\t\r\n4-piece bathroom suite with cabinet shower, whb, and wc. Wheelchair friendly. \r\n\r\nBedroom 1: 4.2m x 3.92m\t\r\nLocated on the ground floor. \r\n\r\nBedroom 2: 4.1m x 2.96m\t\r\nLocated on the ground floor. \r\n\r\nBedroom 3: 3.7m x 3.03m\t\r\nLocated on the first floor.\r\n\r\nBedroom 4: 2.86m x 3.03m\t\r\nLocated on the first floor. \r\n\r\nBedroom 5: 2.98m x 2.76m\r\nLocated on the ground floor. \r\n\r\nBathroom: 2.9m x 2m\t\r\nLocated on the first floor. Full bathroom suite with bath and separate shower, whc, and wc."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Newly constructed in 2023/24\r\nDouble glazing and gas central heating throughout\r\nParking for two cars\r\nJust a short walk into the city centre\r\nB3 BER - 118448919\r\nSouth facing back garden\r\nOverlooking Fitzgerald’s Park\r\nBuilt to a very high standard\r\nPreviously rented out and easily returned to a family residence"
      },
      {
